  "signal_basis": {
    "component_id": "C038.signal_basis",
    "value": "Following a documented reduction in concurrency with worker version and other controllable settings fixed, observe the timing and changes in queue depth, completion rate, and phase durations relative to baseline and any unchanged comparison pool. Phase-duration improvement after actual concurrency falls supports contention sensitivity; similar service phases with increased queue delay favor reduced capacity as the explanation of that response.",
